# Frontend Environment Configuration (Vite)
# If deploying fullstack in a single container or behind a proxy (like Nginx/Express), leave as /api
# If deploying frontend separately (e.g. Vercel, Netlify, Render Static Site), set to your backend URL:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-api.onrender.com/api
VITE_API_URL=/api
